msgid ""
"We are starting close to home, in the Dutch Caribbean — and rolling out "
"worldwide from there."
msgstr ""
"Empezamos cerca de casa, en el Caribe neerlandés, y desde allí nos "
"expandimos por todo el mundo."

msgid ""
"We were tired of watching that. So Mitabon works the other way round — you "
"book straight with the host, the money never passes through us, and no "
"platform commission inflates the price. Fair for you, fair for the people "
"who open their doors."
msgstr ""
"Nos cansamos de verlo. Por eso Mitabon funciona al revés: reservas "
"directamente con el anfitrión, el dinero nunca pasa por nosotros y ninguna "
"comisión de plataforma infla el precio. Justo para ti, justo para quienes "
"abren sus puertas."

